    <div class="intro">
      <h3 style="color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;">🎿 Day 10 Overview</h3>
      <p>The second week of the Games kicks off with another blockbuster programme. The women's super-G races on Cortina's iconic Tofane, the biathlon mixed relay adds a team-format thriller in Anterselva, the women's moguls final crowns a champion under lights in Livigno, the luge doubles deliver synchronised sliding at Cesana, the short track men's 1000m final explodes in Milan, the epic men's 10000m challenges speed skating's ultimate endurance athletes, Nordic combined makes its Milano-Cortina debut in Predazzo, and figure skating's men's free skate determines the Olympic champion. Eight medal events on a packed Monday.</p>
    </div>

