        <li>Freestyle Skiing Women's Moguls Final — gold medal run at Livigno</li>
        <li>Luge Doubles Final at Cesana — German dominance challenged</li>
        <li>Short Track Men's 1000m Final — explosive sprint for gold in Milan</li>
        <li>Speed Skating Men's 10000m — the ultimate endurance test</li>
        <li>Nordic Combined Individual Normal Hill/10km — jump &amp; ski at Predazzo/Tesero</li>
        <li>Figure Skating Men's Free Skate — crowning the Olympic champion</li>
        <li>Snowboard Halfpipe Qualification — men's &amp; women's at Livigno</li>
      </ul>
